p.src:
The local mechanism is: $\text{unstructured freedom}
\longrightarrow
\text{boredom}
\longrightarrow
\text{search for relief}
\longrightarrow
\text{risk of idle drift}.$ This should not be treated as medical advice or as a universal theory of founders. It is a source-backed behavioral warning: removing work pressure does not automatically create a healthy next structure.

